      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Pinned source joins platforms with a comma. Native templates cannot join arrays, so platforms is a comma-separated string matching the wire query.",
        "limit (1-1000), lastDays (>=0), status, type, startDate, endDate, and autoRepostId are caller controlled. Provider next/cache timestamps are metadata and are never followed."
